            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c7000",
              "x": 208,
              "y": 28,
              "name": "窗口标题",
              "fill": "#E7B85B",
              "effect": {
                "type": "shadow",
                "shadowType": "outer",
                "color": "#1A120A99",
                "offset": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 2
                },
                "blur": 2
              },
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 300,
              "content": "EraWheel 轮回系统",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c8000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 206,
              "name": "介绍标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "轮回系统是什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c9000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 252,
              "name": "介绍正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "轮回系统负责阶段推进、双封印、胜利结算和下一轮重置。\n它像整套 MOD 的总进度条，决定世界何时从发展走向危机。\n玩家主要通过轮回窗口查看轮回数、当前阶段、封印进度和世界档位。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cb000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 405,
              "name": "流程标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "一轮轮回怎么推进",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cc000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 451,
              "name": "流程正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "1. 预发展：世界扩人口、建城市，等待人口达标。\n2. 预兆：名单锁定，据点生成，将领封印开始衰减。\n3. 苏醒：将领登场，魔王封印开始衰减。\n4. 降临：魔王实体出现，最终战正式开始。\n5. 战后重建：结算奖励，写入历史，开启下一轮。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ce000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 632,
              "name": "系统入口标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "胜利结算做什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cf000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 678,
              "name": "系统入口正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "最后一名存活魔王被击败后，系统进入战后重建。\n结算顺序固定为：结算战果 → 发放轮回进阶 → 重置阶段。\n随后写入轮回历史，轮回数按 +1 处理。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "cg000",
